Roadmap for Accelerating Waste Management in Langsa City 2025-2026

The objectives of developing the Roadmap for the Action Plan for Accelerating Waste Management in Langsa City are:

a) To obtain an overview of waste management in Langsa City, particularly at the Pondok Keumuning Landfill;

b) To formulate an action plan and targets for waste management in Langsa City;

c)To serve as a basis for developing strategic steps to address waste management issues in Langsa City;

d) To serve as a reference in developing waste management policies in Langsa City;

e) To serve as a reference for developing sanitation development in the field of waste management in Langsa City;

f) To serve as a reference for increasing stakeholder awareness in Langsa City regarding mainstreaming sanitation development in the field of waste management;

g) To reduce the amount of waste entering the Pondok Keumuning Landfill; and

h) To resolve the waste problem in Langsa City.

